#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:127
msgid "Create a user as instance hostname during provisioning."
msgstr "Create un usuario as instance hostname durante provisioning."

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:128
msgid ""
"Below is the playbook. Add this playbook to a task and run it as a "
"workflow on the instance."
msgstr ""
"Below es el playbook. Add este playbook to una tarea y run it as un flujo"
" de trabajo on la instancia."

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:129
msgid ""
"---\n"
"  - name: Add a user\n"
"    hosts: all\n"
"    gather_facts: false\n"
"    tasks:\n"
"      - name: Add User\n"
"        win_user:\n"
"          name: \"{{ morpheus['instance']['hostname'] }}\"\n"
"          password: \"xxxxxxx\"\n"
"          state: present"
msgstr ""
"---\n"
"  - nombre: Add un usuario\n"
"    hosts: todos\n"
"    gather_facts: false\n"
"    tasks:\n"
"      - nombre: Add User\n"
"        win_user:\n"
"          nombre: \"{{ morpheus['instance']['hostname'] }}\"\n"
"          contraseña: \"xxxxxxx\"\n"
"          state: present"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:142
msgid ""
"``{{ morpheus['instance']['hostname'] }}`` is the format of using "
"|morpheus| Variables"
msgstr ""
"``{{ morpheus['instance']['hostname'] }}`` es el formato of using "
"|morpheus| Variables"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/ansible.rst:144
msgid ""
